---
title: Whiskey Sour
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, whiskey]
source: Our own
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @whiskey{2%fl_oz}, @lemon juice{1%fl_oz}. Add @superfine sugar{1%tsp}. Shake well for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Garnish with an @orange{1%slice} and a @cocktail cherry{1}.

> option to add an egg white when shaking to make a Boston sour; shake longer if added.
